<http://www.example.org/rirpdm> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Julian Paulussen" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "OWL 2 ontology for knowledge representation and reasoning over scientific research infrastructure and publications."@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Research Infrastructure and Research Publications Data Model (RIRPDM)"@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Imports of fabio and cito are resolved via catalog-v001.xml to locally patched copies (ontology/fabio.owl, ontology/cito.owl): upstream published files assert untyped dcterms:created/modified literals on their own ontology IRI, violating the xsd:dateTime range they themselves declare, which makes the raw remote files OWL-inconsistent (owl:Thing SubClassOf owl:Nothing). Only those two literals were retyped; no domain classes/properties/axioms were altered."@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.0" .
