<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#DistributedRI> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ESFRI Roadmap 2026" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#DistributedRI> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#DistributedRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An RI made up of a Central Hub plus interlinked National Nodes; the Hub coordinates and manages each Node's RI-dedicated capacity under the RI Consortium's shared rules."@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#DistributedRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Distributed RI"@en .
# 
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ResearchInfrastructure> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ESFRI Roadmap 2026" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ResearchInfrastructure> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "EU Regulation 2021 Art 2" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ResearchInfrastructure> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ResearchInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A facility (or set of resources/services) enabling research and innovation."@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#ResearchInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Research Infrastructure"@en .
# 
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#SingleSitedRI> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ESFRI Roadmap 2026" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#SingleSitedRI> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#SingleSitedRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An RI concentrated geographically at one site (or a few complementary sites) designed for user access. (ESFRI Roadmap 2026, p.15)"@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#SingleSitedRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Single-sited RI"@en .
# 
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#VirtualRI> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ESFRI Roadmap 2026" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#VirtualRI> <http://www.example.org/rirpdm#status> "New" .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#VirtualRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An RI with no fixed physical site: its resources and services are accessed remotely rather than in person."@en .
<http://www.example.org/rirpdm#VirtualRI> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Virtual RI"@en .
